ance and extends to 3 0cm from the superior margin  3 0cm from the inferior margin  and 5 5cm from the lateral tip  The nipple and areola appear unremarkable  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 8cm blood filled cavity occupies the central region and extends into the outer aspect and to 0 2cm from the posterior margin  The parenchyma surrounding the hematoma shows diffuse fibrosis and hemorrhage  The lower outer quadrant contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  well circumscribed  tan pink firm nodule situated 2 5cm inferior to the blood filled cavity and extending to 2 0cm from the posterior resection margin  The upper outer quadrant contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 2cm  irregular  tan pink to gray white  firm mass with a metal clip in the center 2 0cm superior to the blood filled cavity and extending to 2 5cm from the anterior margin and 1 8cm from the posterior margin  The lower inner quadrant contains a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm pink white firm partly cystic mass located 2 3cm from the posterior margin  The remaining parenchyma consists of admixed fatty tissue and pink white fibrous stroma with areas of hemorrhage  The following representative sections are submitted   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Blood filled cavity with surrounding breast parenchyma from medial to lateral   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Entire lower outer quadrant nodule   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma adjacent to the nodule in the lower outer quadrant   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Mass in the upper outer quadrant with cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing tissue adjacent to the metal clip   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma with partly cystic mass in the lower inner quadrant  Unfixed  labeled  Kathleen Mitchell  REMOVED_DATE  nonsentinel node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm tan pink lymph node  which is entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1    1A   LEFT SENTINEL LYMPH NODES   FO