oved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  10 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 14 28 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Two specimens are received  each  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  Received fresh  designate  left breast  is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm breast tissue containing two guide wires and oriented by a short stitch superiorly and a long stitch lateral  In the lateral aspect of the tissue is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm ill defined  firm  tan yellow nodule  0 5cm from the posterior margin  and greater than 1cm from all other margins  In the medial aspect  near the second guide wire  there is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 x 1cm ill defined  white  fibrous and focally yellow and focally hemorrhagic nodule  0 2cm from the anterior margin  0 3cm from the inferior margin  0 5cm from the superior margin  and greater than 1cm from the other margins  SECTION CODE A E  Entire lesion  1 with deep margin  F G  Lesion  2 with anterior  red  and inferior margins  H  Lesion  2  with anterior  red  and superior margins  I  Lesion  2 with superior margin  J  Lesion  2 with anterior margin  K  Representative parenchyma with lateral margin  L  Representative parenchym with superior margin  M  Representative parenchyma with deep margin  N  Representative parenchyma with inferior margin  O  Representative parenchyma  Received in formalin  designated  left breast  final shaved margins  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 8cm tissue with two stitches marking the surface adjacent to the tumor  The opposite surface from the stitches is inked black  Representative sections are in P through Y  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID